<title>SPAIN: KDB issues 10 bln ptas 3-yr 5.45 pct matador.</title>
<headline>KDB issues 10 bln ptas 3-yr 5.45 pct matador.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Korean Development Bank is issuing a 10-billion peseta three-year 5.45 percent Matador at 101.007 percent, joint leads Citibank and BCH said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>Total commissions are 1.25 percent. The pay date is June 19, 1997 and the maturity date June 19, 2000.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
